@host = https://localhost:7257
@email = vinicius@teste.com
@password = Teste@12345

### 1. Registro com senha fraca → esperado 400 com a lista de regras
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "abc"
}

### 2. Registro válido → esperado 201 com o id
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. Registro duplicado (rode o 2 de novo) → esperado 400 DuplicateUserName/DuplicateEmail
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 4. Login → esperado 204 com o header Set-Cookie
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 5. Me com o cookie → esperado 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Cookie: {{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### 6. Me sem cookie → esperado 401
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me

### 7. Logout → esperado 204, com Set-Cookie expirando o cookie
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Cookie: {{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### 8. Login com senha errada → rode 5 vezes: 401, 401, 401, 401, 429
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "SenhaErrada@1"
}